          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures Podman Desktop UI/extension settings (%APPDATA%\\Podman Desktop\\configuration) and per-user container engine config (%USERPROFILE%\\.config\\containers\\*.conf, policy.json). Registry auth (auth.json) and TLS credentials are blocked from auto-restore. Confidence: medium - directory layout confirmed from upstream source and community reports; exact configuration subdirectory depth may vary across Podman Desktop versions. Authored secret warning: auth.json contains OCI registry credentials (base64-encoded username:password tokens). Private key and certificate files MUST NOT be auto-restored. Review manually and re-authenticate with 'podman login' after provisioning. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %USERPROFILE%\\.config\\containers\\auth.json, %USERPROFILE%\\.config\\containers\\*.pem, %USERPROFILE%\\.config\\containers\\*.key, %USERPROFILE%\\.config\\containers\\*.crt"
